I come back to my flat.
It is very humid outside.
But it is nice and quiet in the house.
I put my bags on the bed.
I take the new clothes out of the bag.
That new cotton shirt looks very beautiful.
I want to try it on now.
I put the shirt on.
But there is a problem.
It is very tight near the shoulders.
This shirt is too small for me.
It is smaller than my old shirt.
I need a bigger shirt than this.
I did not try this shirt on in the shop.
That was my mistake.
I take off that shirt.
The receipt is right in my purse.
The receipt is safe in my purse.
Tomorrow I will go to the shop to exchange this shirt.
